      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Lagos carries the densest standby and prime generation base in Nigeria, from the Ikeja and Agbara factory belts to the terminals at Apapa and Tin Can Island. We overhaul steam and gas turbines, maintain industrial gensets and diagnose rotating equipment on outage windows that cannot slip.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
