<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Lagos is the country's industrial and commercial capital, and its plants run their prime movers harder than plants anywhere else in Nigeria. The manufacturing clusters at Ikeja, Ilupeju, Isolo, Agbara and Odogunyan in Ikorodu, together with the cold stores, cranes and processing lines around Apapa and Tin Can Island, sit on a distribution supply that swings often enough to keep diesel sets and turbines in near continuous duty. That duty profile, rather than machine age alone, is what drives most of the failures we are called in to correct.</p><p>We cover the full rotating train: back pressure and condensing steam turbines on boiler plant, industrial and aeroderivative gas turbines, diesel and gas gensets from a few hundred kVA to multi megawatt synchronised banks, and the pumps, compressors, fans and gearboxes coupled to them. Every scope begins with measurement rather than assumption, so you know what is worn, what is fouled and what can safely run to the next window. Start with <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/">steam turbine overhaul</a>, <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/">generator maintenance</a> or a full <a href="/power-plant-audit-nigeria/">power plant audit</a>, then request a technical proposal with the findings and costs written down.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Lagos</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Lagos Plants</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Steam and Gas Turbine Overhaul</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Combustion, hot gas path and major inspections on industrial gas turbines, plus rotor, diaphragm and bearing work on the steam sets that run alongside boiler plant in Lagos food, beverage and process factories. Borescope findings, clearance records and torque records are handed over with the machine.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Industrial Generator Maintenance</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Scheduled servicing, AVR and governor tuning, synchronising panel checks and load bank testing for the dense standby fleet across Ikeja, Ilupeju, Agbara and Ikorodu. We correct the wet stacking and injector fouling that comes from long hours at low load on off spec AGO.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Rotating Equipment Services</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Laser shaft alignment, field and workshop balancing, vibration surveys and bearing replacement on pumps, screw and centrifugal compressors, ID and FD fans and gearboxes. Port side and coastal installations in Apapa and Amuwo Odofin get particular attention on seal and coupling condition.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Plant Assessment and Power Audit</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A structured survey of your Lagos site: generation and load profile, fuel consumption per kWh, redundancy gaps, protection settings and deferred maintenance. You receive a written condition register and a costed intervention plan you can take to procurement.</p>
      </div>
</div>
